      "seed": 1814665180,
      "version": 511,
      "versionNonce": 1454286556,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1782304897166,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-functional\n1. availability >> consistency\n2. support low latency operations (<10mis to get/set requests)\n3. scalability -- support expected 1TB of data, 100k requests/sec\n=====================================\n* durability\n* strong consistency guarantees\n* complex querying capabilities\n* transaction support",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-functional\n1. availability >> consistency\n2. support low latency operations (<10mis to get/set requests)\n3. scalability -- support expected 1TB of data, 100k requests/sec\n=====================================\n* durability\n* strong consistency guarantees\n* complex querying capabilities\n* transaction support",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8B8UuyE-VRKYKAKkodh5D",
      "type": "rectangle",
